        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Goofy Giraffe Game</strong> is an 3D platform game where we embody... a giraffe. But not just a giraffe ! A giraffe with a broken neck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure comes in two parts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Neck</strong> – dive into the story and discover the delightfully absurd rivalry between Softy and the Cube Rouge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long Neck</strong> – take on a loooooooong and perilous challenge as you climb a tower so tall that no one has ever seen its peak.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Softy might get a little sad if she found out you stopped at the Short Neck… you wouldn’t do that to her, right?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The <i>Cube Rouge</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/fd5cad10fd7ed407cc22bf7c7e91885d.poster.avif?t=1763072805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/fd5cad10fd7ed407cc22bf7c7e91885d.webm?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/fd5cad10fd7ed407cc22bf7c7e91885d.mp4?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This giraffe will never escape from this bedroom ! She is too weak to go far !</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I just hope she won't find <strong>the spots</strong>, they could maybe help her to go higher...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And it jumps, and it bounces, again and again !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure with Softy, who wants to free herself and all the toys in the room from the evil Cube Rouge, who plans to enslave all the toys under his control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Softy is goofy </strong>: She has short legs and a floppy neck, so she has to break her neck to jump really high. Weird, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.poster.avif?t=1763072805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.webm?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.mp4?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own path</strong> : The evil Cube Rouge thief has stolen little Softy's spots. Don't you want to help her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.poster.avif?t=1763072805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.webm?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.mp4?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Softy is a big fan of carrots</strong> : Yum yum, Softy likes carrots. FIND THEM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2c73be52d4b570433312d8ab07c86bfb.poster.avif?t=1763072805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2c73be52d4b570433312d8ab07c86bfb.webm?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2c73be52d4b570433312d8ab07c86bfb.mp4?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original home-made sound effects </strong> : Enjoy sound effects made by the developers' mouths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2f7c4531ce02ed1d767c3235cd71a269.poster.avif?t=1763072805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2f7c4531ce02ed1d767c3235cd71a269.webm?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2f7c4531ce02ed1d767c3235cd71a269.mp4?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if it jumped even higher ?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that once the adventure is over, Softy faces an even crazier challenge… <strong>“The Long Neck”!</strong><br>An <strong>ENORMOUS</strong>, <strong>ridiculously difficult</strong>, and <strong>very, very tall</strong> ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb endlessly, bounce off everything you can, and try to reach the top (if there even is one…).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some say it goes higher than the moon… but hey, that’s probably just gossip, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Look <strong>how sad is Softy</strong> if you're not playing with her.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/2fe3b6f1ee7e937f3a197dfccc0ba8c6.avif?t=1763072805\" width=264 height=264 /></span></p>",
