 herself and all the toys in the room from the evil Cube Rouge, who plans to enslave all the toys under his control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Softy is goofy </strong>: She has short legs and a floppy neck, so she has to break her neck to jump really high. Weird, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.poster.avif?t=1763072805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.webm?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/e67a5669fd126077d02af299319123aa.mp4?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own path</strong> : The evil Cube Rouge thief has stolen little Softy's spots. Don't you want to help her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.poster.avif?t=1763072805\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.webm?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863110/extras/f2f1c99ace44b2f356516fac5ab481a1.mp4?t=1763072805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Softy is a big fan of carrots</strong> : Yum yum, Softy likes carrots. FIND T